# Evenor platform rules

- Keep hexagonal boundaries: domain has no FastAPI/SQLAlchemy imports.
- Every DB query on tenant data MUST filter by `tenant_id` (repos take `tenant_id` in `__init__`).
- LanceDB path: `data/lancedb/{slug}/` only — never a shared index across tenants.
- Public chat: `POST /c/{slug}/chat` + Bearer token; reject if token tenant slug != path slug.
- Admin routes: `Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN`.
- One Alembic revision per schema change; tests use `create_db_engine(..., for_tests=True)`.
